I've attached six planned routes for the overnight handoff discussion. Could =
you and Mihoko look at how the next day's window is passed to the next person=
 aloud?

R-611 and R-614 have the same Friday morning window but are a week apart. On =
R-615 only the end of the window falls on the following date. The dates and t=
imes on the sheet are local to the place named in each column.

Thanks,
Christine

